Bundle-Name: Fennec OGC Features Viewer
Bundle-Description: A MapLibre GL JS map viewer for the Fennec OGC API Features server: one \
 toggleable layer per collection, grouped and styled from the collection metadata, served \
 under /ogc/viewer. Bundles MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause).

-includeresource.web: web=web

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.component.annotations;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.servlet;version=latest,\
	org.apache.felix.http.servlet-api;version=latest
